# The business model of __PROJECT_DISPLAY_NAME__.
# Edit this file while 'bever dev' runs: the API and the app follow every save.
# Language reference: https://bever.dev/reference/language

# People sign in with an email address and a password, and can create their own account.
Identity
    Registration Enabled

Entity Project
    Field Name Text(120)
    Field Status Enum(Planned, Active, Completed) = Planned
    Field Description Text(2000)?

Entity Task
    Field Title Text(200)
    Field Project -> Project OnDelete Cascade
    Field Status Enum(ToDo, InProgress, Done) = ToDo
    Field Priority Enum(Low, Normal, High) = Normal
    Field DueDate Date?
    Field Assignee -> Identity?
    Field Notes Text(4000)?

    Present
        Listing
            Fields Title, Project, Status, Priority, DueDate, Assignee

# Every signed-in person can manage projects and tasks.
Action Crud Project
    By Authenticated
    OrderBy Name

Action Crud Task
    By Authenticated
    OrderBy DueDate
